{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements:\n\n- Target: 20 distinct candidates\n- Interest: 家常烹饪 (home cooking), focusing on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. Explicitly NOT interested in restaurant business operations or kitchen appliance promotions.\n- All candidates are from \"Open Web\" source, all articles.\n\nLet me examine the candidates. The interest explicitly excludes content about 餐饮门店经营 (restaurant operations) or 厨电促销 (kitchen appliance promotions). Several candidates are \"市场观察\" (market observation) type articles that analyze 连锁餐饮门店选址、加盟合同和外卖促销 (chain restaurant location, franchise contracts, delivery promotions) and 厨电套餐折扣 (kitchen appliance package discounts). These should be excluded as they don't match the interest.\n\nLet me identify the content types:\n- 概念速览 (concept overview)\n- 操作记录 (operation records)\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles)\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation) - these describe 地方饮食历史、节庆习俗、餐桌礼仪、菜名演变与民间故事 (local food history, festival customs, table etiquette, dish name evolution, folk stories)\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - these are about restaurant business and appliance promotions - EXCLUDE\n\nThe interest is about 家常烹饪 with reproducible methods, ingredient handling, cooking principles. The 专题观察 articles about local food history/customs/etiquette are somewhat tangential but still cooking-related. The 市场观察 articles are explicitly excluded by the interest (不关注餐饮门店经营或厨电促销).\n\nLet me count the candidates. There are 80 candidates in the working set. I need to select 20.\n\nLet me categorize the candidates by their content type. The market observation ones should be excluded. Let me identify them:\n\nMarket observation candidates (to exclude):\n- item-18affaa8aa1e (鸡胸肉口感 市场观察)\n- item-1c455877dcbb (蒸鱼 市场观察)\n- item-20be4b3109e6 (番茄炒蛋 市场观察)\n- item-29a2ceb5a219 (蒸鱼 市场观察)\n- item-2bc251faf37d (蔬菜焯水 市场观察)\n- item-2dd514471f2d (煎豆腐 市场观察)\n- item-30ba6b1bdace (面团发酵 市场观察)\n- item-31ef127a8f01 (番茄炒蛋 市场观察)\n- item-3b75b14db3a2 (米饭含水量 市场观察)\n- item-3ccd8e917ed5 (米饭含水量 市场观察)\n- item-45153d453613 (鸡胸肉口感 市场观察)\n- item-48f6b3f401da (鸡胸肉口感 市场观察)\n- item-494354763cad (面团发酵 市场观察)\n- item-510ecf76ae65 (蔬菜焯水 市场观察)\n- item-51661c044642 (蒸鱼 市场观察)\n- item-5499ab1667d3 (面团发酵 市场观察)\n- item-5752095dcba2 (煎豆腐 市场观察)\n\nThese market observation articles are about restaurant business and appliance promotions, which the interest explicitly does not care about. So exclude them.\n\nThe 专题观察 articles are about local food history, festival customs, table etiquette, dish name evolution, folk stories. These are somewhat tangential to the interest's focus on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. However, they are still cooking-related content. Hmm. The interest says \"关注可复现做法、食材处理和烹饪原理\" (focus on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, cooking principles). The 专题观察 content about food history/customs is less aligned with the core focus but not explicitly excluded.\n\nGiven I need 20 candidates and there are many candidates, I should prioritize the ones most aligned with the interest: 操作记录 (operation records - reproducible methods), 条件与原理 (conditions and principles - cooking principles), and 概念速览 (concept overviews). These directly match the interest's focus on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles.\n\nLet me think about which candidates best match. The interest emphasizes:\n1. 可复现做法 (reproducible methods) → 操作记录\n2. 食材处理 (ingredient handling) → 操作记录, 条件与原理\n3. 烹饪原理 (cooking principles) → 条件与原理\n\nThe 概念速览 provides a problem catalog for further reading.\n\nLet me select a balanced set across the different dishes and content types, avoiding the market observation ones.\n\nLet me identify the dishes/topics:\n- 煎豆腐 (pan-fried tofu)\n- 煎饺 (pan-fried dumplings)\n- 米饭含水量 (rice water content)\n- 清汤调味 (clear soup seasoning)\n- 蒸鱼 (steamed fish)\n- 番茄炒蛋 (tomato scrambled eggs)\n- 鸡胸肉口感 (chicken breast texture)\n- 面团发酵 (dough fermentation)\n- 炖牛肉 (braised beef)\n- 蔬菜焯水 (vegetable blanching)\n\nContent types:\n- 概念速览 (concept overview)\n- 操作记录 (operation record)\n- 条件与原理 (conditions & principles)\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation)\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - EXCLUDE\n\nLet me select 20 candidates that are most aligned. I'll prioritize 操作记录 and 条件与原理 (most aligned with reproducible methods and cooking principles), plus some 概念速览.\n\nLet me list the non-market candidates available and pick a balanced set.\n\nLet me identify all candidates and their types. Given the large number, let me focus on selecting 20 good ones.\n\nLet me pick candidates that are 操作记录 (operation records) and 条件与原理 (conditions/principles) across different dishes, plus a few 概念速览.\n\nOperation records available:\n- item-024e99402549 煎饺 工作日备餐 操作记录\n- item-02ec789dd9bf 清汤调味 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-085ac75e2f6f 煎豆腐 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-1635bae1e58d 米饭含水量 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-1d12fb72a0b5 蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-2062e507d111 蒸鱼 两人晚餐 操作记录\n- item-2802591dd8c9 蔬菜焯水 工作日备餐 操作记录\n- item-342993e68175 炖牛肉 工作日备餐 操作记录\n- item-41f1925e3d74 米饭含水量 工作日备餐 操作记录\n- item-4736b753745c 煎饺 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-47ec3b435037 番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐 操作记录\n- item-52719ddc4224 面团发酵 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-52c20cae5610 蔬菜焯水 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-58677ff38120 面团发酵 小份试做 操作记录\n\nConditions & principles available:\n- item-0714769b6401 煎豆腐 两人晚餐 条件与原理\n- item-0ac37da79bac 蒸鱼 工作日备餐 条件与原理\n- item-0ef03b868945 鸡胸肉口感 小份试做 条件与原理\n- item-1f7a4e5259fb 蔬菜焯水 小份试做 条件与原理\n- item-20168695fc11 清汤调味 家庭周末午餐 条件与原理\n- item-20d117d62c34 番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐 条件与原理\n- item-2bd3f1c7d71a 面团发酵 家庭周末午餐 条件与原理\n- item-3302498cd23d 煎饺 两人晚餐 条件与原理\n- item-33a0f6fe41f5 蒸鱼 小份试做 条件与原理\n- item-34eb4892cc8d 蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐 条件与原理\n- item-39131d1ff5ce 清汤调味 小份试做 条件与原理\n- item-508ee443dfc5 煎饺 小份试做 条件与原理\n- item-5adc97f63de0 煎豆腐 工作日备餐 条件与原理\n- item-5b3fc88bc33f 鸡胸肉口感 工作日备餐 条件与原理\n\nConcept overviews available (many).\n\nGiven the interest strongly emphasizes reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles, I'll build a collection of 20 that balances across dishes and prioritizes operation records and conditions/principles, with some concept overviews for breadth.\n\nLet me select 20. I want to cover a good variety of dishes. Let me aim for a balanced set.\n\nLet me select these 20:\n\nOperation records (reproducible methods - core interest):\n1. item-024e99402549 煎饺 工作日备餐 操作记录\n2. item-02ec789dd9bf 清汤调味 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n3. item-085ac75e2f6f 煎豆腐 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n4. item-1635bae1e58d 米饭含水量 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n5. item-1d12fb72a0b5 蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n6. item-2062e507d111 蒸鱼 两人晚餐 操作记录\n7. item-2802591dd8c9 蔬菜焯水 工作日备餐 操作记录\n8. item-342993e68175 炖牛肉 工作日备餐 操作记录\n9. item-4736b753745c 煎饺 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n10. item-47ec3b435037 番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐 操作记录\n11. item-52719ddc4224 面团发酵 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n12. item-52c20cae5610 蔬菜焯水 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n\nConditions & principles (cooking principles - core interest):\n13. item-0714769b6401 煎豆腐 两人晚餐 条件与原理\n14. item-0ac37da79bac 蒸鱼 工作日备餐 条件与原理\n15. item-0ef03b868945 鸡胸肉口感 小份试做 条件与原理\n16. item-1f7a4e5259fb 蔬菜焯水 小份试做 条件与原理\n17. item-20d117d62c34 番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐 条件与原理\n18. item-2bd3f1c7d71a 面团发酵 家庭周末午餐 条件与原理\n19. item-3302498cd23d 煎饺 两人晚餐 条件与原理\n20. item-39131d1ff5ce 清汤调味 小份试做 条件与原理\n\nHmm, but this is heavily weighted toward operation records and conditions/principles. That's fine given the interest focus. But let me reconsider balance. Actually, I should consider whether to include some 概念速览 for variety. But the interest is quite specific about reproducible methods and principles. \n\nActually, let me reconsider. The task says \"balanced across applicable Interests, Sources, and content types.\" All candidates are from the same source (Open Web) and same interest. So balance across content types matters somewhat. But given the interest explicitly focuses on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles, the operation records and conditions/principles are most relevant. Concept overviews provide a problem catalog which is also useful for further reading.\n\nLet me reconsider to include a mix. Actually, I think a good approach is to prioritize the most relevant content types (操作记录 and 条件与原理) while including some 概念速览 for breadth. But I need exactly 20.\n\nLet me reconsider. Given the interest is about home cooking with reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles, and explicitly not about restaurant business or appliance promotions, the market observation articles are clearly out. The 专题观察 articles about food history/customs are less aligned but not excluded.\n\nI'll build a collection of 20 that emphasizes operation records and conditions/principles across a variety of dishes, which best serves the interest. Let me finalize my selection with good coverage of dishes.\n\nLet me verify each selected candidate is present in the list. All the IDs I listed are present.\n\nLet me finalize the 20 and write recommendation reasons grounded in facts.\n\nLet me reconsider whether to include concept overviews. Given the interest description emphasizes reproducible methods and principles, I'll keep the collection focused on operation records and conditions/principles. This provides strong relevance.\n\nActually, let me reconsider balance. I'll include a reasonable mix. Let me finalize with these 20 candidates covering many dishes and both core content types.\n\nLet me write the reasons for each.\n\nLet me publish.","type":"text"},{"arguments":{"items":[{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-024e99402549","recommendationReason":"煎饺在工作日备餐场景下的操作记录，给出食材用量、处理次序、加热强度与时间，并提供过干、出水或不熟时的调整步骤，直接对应你对可复现做法和食材处理的关注。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-02ec789dd9bf","recommendationReason":"清汤调味在家庭周末午餐中的操作记录，记录加热强度与时间并比较不同批次口感，符合你对家常烹饪中可复现做法与调味原理的兴趣。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-085ac75e2f6f","recommendationReason":"煎豆腐在家庭周末午餐中的操作记录，覆盖食材用量、处理次序及过干、出水等常见问题的调整步骤，贴合你对食材处理与可复现做法的关注。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-1635bae1e58d","recommendationReason":"米饭含水量在家庭周末午餐